/-- `0-T`, `0-TOFF` diagonal decode circuit (`S wEn ;; CZ wEn wTh ;; CZ wEn wSlot0`),
cancelling `218 * 7 ≡ 6 (mod 8)` (`th = 0`) with `+2` and `218 * 1 ≡ 2 (mod 8)` (`th = 1`)
